{"id":"ishida-attack","order":1020,"title":{"ja":"石田流本組みの仕掛け：５三銀型と６三銀型への攻め","en":"Ishida Honkumi attacks: against the 5c-silver and 6c-silver setups"},"path":["戦法・定跡","石田流"],"intro":{"ja":"石田流本組みが完成した局面から、後手の構えに応じた仕掛けを学びます。５三銀型には、７筋から飛車を出す攻め、８筋から飛車をぶつける攻め、棒銀風の攻めの三つ。６三銀型には、▲６五歩からの攻めで、同銀と取る形と同桂と取る形の二つを、初手からの局面で確かめます。","en":"From the completed Ishida Honkumi, learn attacks that fit each Gote setup. Against the 5c silver there are three: bring the rook out on the seventh, collide rooks on the eighth, or advance the silver like a Bogin. Against the 6c silver, attack with ▲6五歩 and recapture with the silver or the knight."},"check":{"question":{"ja":"△６三銀型に対して、▲６五歩と仕掛ける前に▲５六銀と上がっておくのはなぜですか？","en":"Against the 6c-silver setup, why play ▲5六銀 before attacking with ▲6五歩?"},"answer":{"ja":"△６五歩と歩を取られても、▲同銀と取り返せて６筋と７筋を押さえられるからです。仕掛けの前に銀を準備しておきます。","en":"So that if Gote captures the pawn on 6e, Sente can recapture with the silver and control the sixth and seventh files. The silver is prepared before the attack."}},"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 石田流本組みの仕掛け (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/6460, All rights reserved)","references":[{"title":"石田流本組みの仕掛け","url":"https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/6460","license":"All rights reserved","adapted":false}],"courses":[{"id":"lesson-ishida-attack-1","title":"石田流本組みの仕掛け：５三銀型と６三銀型への攻め: △５三銀型には飛車をぶつける","titleEn":"Ishida Honkumi attacks: against the 5c-silver and 6c-silver setups: Against the 5c-silver setup, collide the rooks","myStrategy":"lesson","opponentStrategy":"lesson","mySide":"sente","userSide":"sente","noEngine":true,"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 石田流本組みの仕掛け (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/6460, All rights reserved)","goalFormation":"△６四銀と銀を出したところで、▲８五飛と歩を取って飛車をぶつけます。このあと△同飛▲同桂と進み、お互いに飛車を打ち込む攻め合いになります。相手の陣形にすきが生まれたときを見て実行します。","root":{"id":"n0","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/9/PPPPPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7g7f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n1","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9