桂 follows, and both sides drop rooks into each other's camps. Choose the moment when Gote's formation has a gap.","figures":[{"id":"1-4","marks":{"last":"8e","arrows":["8e8b"],"boxes":["8b","8e"]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"△７三歩と打たれたら、飛車を▲７五へ引きます。引いた飛車は、次の８筋への動きを見ています。一歩得をして、飛車が自由になりました。","commentEn":"When Gote drops △7三歩, the rook retreats to 7e. The retreated rook now eyes the eighth file. Sente is a pawn up and the rook is free.","figures":[{"id":"1-3","marks":{"last":"7e","arrows":["7e8e"],"boxes":["8e","7e"]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"後手が△４四歩と突いたところで、▲７四歩と歩を合わせます。△同歩に▲同飛と取り、飛車が７四へ出ます。７筋の歩がなくなって、後手の７三が空きました。","commentEn":"After △4四歩, Sente plays ▲7四歩. △同歩 ▲同飛 takes, and the rook comes out to 7d. With the seventh-file pawn gone, the square 7c is open.","figures":[{"id":"1-2","marks":{"last":"7d","boxes":["7c","7d"]}}]}}]}}]}},{"usi":"6g5f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n46","sfen":"ln3g1nl/1r2g1s2/2pps1bk1/p3ppppp/1pP6/P1RPS3P/BPN1PPPP1/4G1SK1/L4G1NL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"5b4c","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n47","sfen":"ln3g1nl/1r4s2/2ppsgbk1/p3ppppp/1pP6/P1RPS3P/BPN1PPPP1/4G1SK1/L4G1NL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"5f6e","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n48","sfen":"ln3g1nl/1r4s2/2ppsgbk1/p3ppppp/1pPS5/P1RP4P/BPN1PPPP1/4G1SK1/L4G1NL w - 1","branches":[],"comment":"三つ目の攻めは、棒銀のように銀を進めることです。▲５六銀から▲６五銀と出ます。次に▲７四歩△同歩▲同銀と、単純ですが受けにくい攻めがあります。","commentEn":"The third attack pushes the silver like a Bogin: ▲5六銀 then ▲6五銀. Next comes ▲7四歩 △同歩 ▲同銀, a simple attack that is hard to meet.","figures":[{"id":"1-v2"}]}}]}}]}}]}},{"usi":"8b8d","kind":"deviation","child":{"id":"n42","sfen":"ln3g1nl/4g1s2/2ppspbk1/pr2p1ppp/1pP6/P1RP4P/BPNSPPPP1/4G1SK1/L4G1NL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8g8f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n43","sfen":"ln3g1nl/4g1s2/2ppspbk1/pr2p1ppp/1pP6/PPRP4P/B1NSPPPP1/4G1SK1/L4G1NL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8e8f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n44","sfen":"ln3g1nl/4g1s2/2ppspbk1/pr2p1ppp/2P6/PpRP4P/B1NSPPPP1/4G1SK1/L4G1NL b p 1","branches":[{"usi":"7f8f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n45","sfen":"ln3g1nl/4g1s2/2ppspbk1/pr2p1ppp/2P6/PR1P4P/B1NSPPPP1/4G1SK1/L4G1NL w Pp 1","branches":[],"comment":"後手が△８六歩と取れば▲同飛、△８五歩と受けても▲同飛です。どちらでも先手の飛車が前へ出て、飛車交換が避けられなくなります。","commentEn":"△8六歩 ▲同飛 follows. Even △8五歩 is met by ▲同飛, so Gote has to accept the rook trade. The aim is the same: trade rooks.","figures":[{"id":"1-v1-1","marks":{"last":"8f","arrows":["8f8d"],"boxes":["8d","8f"]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"二つ目の攻めです。後手が７筋の攻めを嫌って△８四飛と浮いたら、▲８六歩と８筋から仕掛けます。","commentEn":"The second attack. If Gote avoids the seventh-file attack by floating the rook with △8四飛, Sente starts on the eighth file with ▲8六歩.","figures":[{"id":"1-v1"}]}}]}}],"comment":"石田流本組みに対して、後手が５三へ銀を上げて囲いを組んだ局面です。この構えは７筋が薄く、石田流の攻めが通りやすくなります。ここからの攻めは三つあります。一つ目は７筋の歩を交換して飛車を前へ出す攻めです。","commentEn":"Sente has an Ishida Honkumi and Gote has built with the silver on 5c. This setup is thin on the seventh file, so Sente's attack works well. There are three attacks. The first is to exchange the seventh-file pawn and bring the rook forward.","figures":[{"id":"1-1","marks":{"last":"9g","boxes":["7c","7d"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}},{"id":"lesson-ishida-attack-2","title":"石田流本組みの仕掛け：５三銀型と６三銀型への攻め: △６三銀型には▲６五歩から仕掛ける","titleEn":"Ishida Honkumi attacks: against the 5c-silver and 6c-silver setups: Against the 6c-silver setup, attack with ▲6五歩","myStrategy":"lesson","opponentStrategy":"lesson","mySide":"sente","userSide":"sente","noEngine":true,"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 石田流本組みの仕掛け (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/6460, All rights reserved)","goalFormation":"▲７四歩△同銀に▲６四銀が手筋です。７七の角の利きが６四の銀を支え、後手の飛車を止めます。ここから▲７三銀成や▲５三銀成と、銀と角で攻めを続けられます。飛車で攻めると見せて角筋を生かす攻めです。\nまとめです。５三銀型には飛車をぶつける攻めと棒銀風の攻め、６三銀型には▲６五歩からの攻めが基本です。▲６五同銀なら角筋を使って６筋を押さえ、▲６五同桂なら成り捨てて攻めを続けます。","root":{"id":"n49","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/9/PPPPPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7g7f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n50","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/2P6