"ln3g1nl/3rg1s2/2p3bk1/p1sSppppp/1p7/P1R5P/BPN1PPPP1/4G1SK1/L4G1NL w P2p 1","branches":[],"comment":"▲７四歩△同銀に▲６四銀が手筋です。７七の角の利きが６四の銀を支え、後手の飛車を止めます。ここから▲７三銀成や▲５三銀成と、銀と角で攻めを続けられます。飛車で攻めると見せて角筋を生かす攻めです。\nまとめです。５三銀型には飛車をぶつける攻めと棒銀風の攻め、６三銀型には▲６五歩からの攻めが基本です。▲６五同銀なら角筋を使って６筋を押さえ、▲６五同桂なら成り捨てて攻めを続けます。","commentEn":"▲7四歩 △同銀 ▲6四銀 is the key move. The bishop's line from 9g supports the silver and stops Gote's rook. Sente can continue with ▲7三銀成 or ▲5三銀成 using silver and bishop. It looks like a rook attack but it uses the bishop's diagonal.\nSummary: against the 5c-silver setup, collide rooks or advance the silver; against the 6c-silver setup, start with ▲6五歩. After a capture with the silver, use the bishop line to control the sixth file; after a capture with the knight, give up the knight by promoting and keep attacking.","figures":[{"id":"2-5","marks":{"last":"6d","arrows":["6d7c","6d5c"],"boxes":["6d","6b"]}},{"id":"2-6"}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"後手は△６二飛と飛車を六筋に回しました。次の▲７四歩に△同銀▲同銀と進むと、△６九飛成が決まるという狙いです。こちらの攻めを逆に利用された形です。","commentEn":"Gote swings the rook with △6二飛. If Sente plays ▲7四歩 △同銀 ▲同銀, then △6九飛成 follows. It turns Sente's own attack against it.","figures":[{"id":"2-4","marks":{"last":"6b","boxes":["6b","6e"]}}]}}],"comment":"△６五歩と取らせたら、▲同銀と取ります。次に▲７四歩△同歩▲６四歩として、角の利きも使いながら６筋と７筋を押さえるのが狙いです。△６四歩と打たれても、構わず▲７四歩と進めればこちらの攻めが決まります。","commentEn":"If Gote takes with △6五歩, Sente recaptures ▲同銀. Next comes ▲7四歩 △同歩 ▲6四歩, using the bishop's line to control the sixth and seventh files. Even if Gote drops △6四歩, ▲7四歩 still wins the attack.","figures":[{"id":"2-3","marks":{"last":"6e","boxes":["6e","7d"]}}]}},{"usi":"7g6e","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n93","sfen":"ln3g1nl/1r2g1s2/2ps2bk1/p3ppppp/1pPN5/P1R1S3P/BP2PPPP1/4G1SK1/L4G1NL w Pp 1","branches":[{"usi":"P*6d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n94","sfen":"ln3g1nl/1r2g1s2/2ps2bk1/p2pppppp/1pPN5/P1R1S3P/BP2PPPP1/4G1SK1/L4G1NL b P 1","branches":[{"usi":"6e7c+","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n95","sfen":"ln3g1nl/1r2g1s2/2+Ns2bk1/p2pppppp/1pP6/P1R1S3P/BP2PPPP1/4G1SK1/L4G1NL w 2P 1","branches":[],"comment":"△６四歩と打たれたら、▲７三桂成と成り捨てます。△同桂と取られても、▲７四歩と攻めが続きます。一瞬は駒損ですが、すぐ取り返せます。","commentEn":"After △6四歩, ▲7三桂成 promotes and gives up the knight. Even if Gote takes with △同桂, ▲7四歩 keeps the attack going. It costs material briefly but wins it back at once.","figures":[{"id":"2-v1-1","marks":{"last":"7c","boxes":["7c"]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"△６五歩に▲同桂と桂で取る攻めもあります。一見すると△６四歩で桂が死にそうですが、そうではありません。","commentEn":"Capturing with the knight, ▲同桂, is also possible. It looks as if △6四歩 would trap the knight, but it does not.","figures":[{"id":"2-v1"}]}}]}}],"comment":"▲５六銀と上がってから、▲６五歩と仕掛けます。銀を先に上げておくことで、６五の歩が取られても▲同銀と取り返せます。仕掛けの前に銀を整えるのが基本です。","commentEn":"First ▲5六銀, then the attack ▲6五歩. With the silver ready, a capture on 6e can be answered by ▲同銀. Preparing the silver before attacking is the rule.","figures":[{"id":"2-2","marks":{"last":"6e","boxes":["6e","5f"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"今度は後手が６三に銀を構えた形です。７四の歩を突いて攻める手を封じていて、石田流に対してはこの形が本筋です。ここでは６筋から仕掛けます。","commentEn":"This time Gote keeps the silver on 6c, which blocks the ▲7四歩 attack. Against Ishida-style it is the main line. Sente attacks on the sixth file instead.","figures":[{"id":"2-1","marks":{"last":"9g","boxes":["6c","7d"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}